/S /P
/P 396 0 R
/ActualText (Workload less per week : One main reason of dropping out is due to very much workload in projects and also some students whose grasping is low they feel overwhelmed by new things. To ensure fairity in this we can give them enough time for basics also because atlast output from the project should be very strong. They should be capable of doing things even if they take time.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
